      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-salah",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "4-5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ṣalāh ist das islamische Gebet, das wir Schritt für Schritt lernen.",
      "lang": "de-DE",
      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-salah",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "6-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ṣalāh ist das vorgeschriebene rituelle Gebet. Seine Durchführung lernen wir aus Qurʾān und authentischer Sunnah.",
      "lang": "de-DE",
      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-salah",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "9-10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duʿāʾ bedeutet: Allah um etwas bitten.",
      "lang": "de-DE",
      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-dua",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "4-5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duʿāʾ ist ein Bittgebet. Wir wenden uns dabei an Allah.",
      "lang": "de-DE",
      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-dua",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "6-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duʿāʾ ist die Hinwendung an Allah im Bittgebet. Menschen dürfen wir um gewöhnliche praktische Hilfe bitten.",
      "lang": "de-DE",
      "voiceProfileId": "serhat-owner-voice-2026",
      "modelId": "eleven_v4",
      "priority": 1,
      "reviewStatus": "not-generated",
      "contexts": [
        {
          "lessonId": "vocabulary-dua",
          "kind": "term-explanation",
          "age": "9-10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunnah bedeutet: Was der Prophet ﷺ uns gelehrt hat.",
